---
import Image from '../assets/og/privacy-policy.webp';
import Strong from '../components/Strong.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const image_url = new URL(Image.src, Astro.site);

const description =
  'How we handle your email address, how we use it and other aspects related to our newsletter and mailing list.';
---

<Layout>
  <Fragment slot="header">
    <title>The Civia Project &mdash; Privacy</title>

    <meta name="description" content={description} />

    <!-- Open Graph -->
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:image" content={image_url} />

    <!-- X Card -->
    <meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content={image_url} />
  </Fragment>
  <div>
    <h1 class="text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <hr class="opacity-25 my-10" />

    <p class="italic">
      This document pertains to our newsletter, how we will use your email
      address and other aspects.
    </p>

    <hr class="opacity-25 my-10" />

    <h2>tl;dr</h2>
    <ol class="list-disc ml-8">
      <li>We do not share it with anyone</li>
      <li>We only use it to notify you</li>
      <li>You can unsubscribe anytime</li>
      <li>
        We will <Strong>permanently delete</Strong> the list once we officially launch
        the platform or when we close shop.
      </li>
      <li>
        We can, on-demand, permanently delete any record we hold of your email
        address.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <hr class="opacity-25 my-8" />

    <h2 class="text-2xl leading-12">1. Information we collect</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      We collect <Strong>only your email address</Strong> when you voluntarily subscribe
      to our mailing list.
    </p>

    <hr class="opacity-25 my-10" />

    <h2 class="text-2xl leading-12">2. How we will use your email address</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      Your email address will be used <Strong>exclusively</Strong> to send updates
      related to our progress as it relates to our mission. Such as, but not limited
      to:
    </p>

    <ol class="list-disc ml-8 mt-8">
      <li>Our online presence and milestones</li>
      <li>Progress on our roadmap</li>
      <li>Features and mentions in news publications</li>
      <li>Other important project-related news</li>
    </ol>

    <p class="mt-8">
      We <Strong>do not</Strong> share, sell, disclose or rent your email address
      to third parties.
    </p>

    <hr class="opacity-25 my-10" />

    <h2 class="text-2xl leading-12">3. Subscription & Unsubscription</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      You can subscribe to our mailing list by providing your email address to
      our sign-up form. You can subscribe at any time and your email address
      will be removed promptly.
    </p>

    <hr class="opacity-25 my-10" />

    <h2 class="text-2xl leading-12">4. Storage</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      Your email will be stored in a database deployed to a <a
        class="underline"
        href="https://turso.tech/">Turso</a
      > Database in Europe until it will be removed either by unsubscribing or at
      the end of our current data retention cycle.
    </p>

    <hr class="opacity-25 my-10" />

    <h2 class="text-2xl leading-12">5. Backups</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      <a class="underline" href="https://turso.tech/">Turso</a> has <a
        class="underline"
        href="https://docs.turso.tech/features/point-in-time-recovery"
        >PITR (Point-in-Time Recovery)</a
      >
    </p>

    <hr class="opacity-25 my-10" />

    <h2 class="text-2xl leading-12">6. Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      We do not retain any other data, metadata except for your email address.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-8">
      If you have unsubscribed until then, our email history will be kept (the
      emails we have sent you via the newsletter) until they end of the project
      &mdash; when we will release or close shop. At everything related to this
      mailing list will be <Strong>permanently deleted</Strong>.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-8">
      Per your request, we can also delete our mailing history with your email
      address. Please contact us and let us know. Your request serves as an
      electronic receipt and it will not be deleted.
    </p>

    <hr class="opacity-25 my-10" />
    <h2 class="text-2xl leading-12">8. API Logging</h2>

    <p class="mt-2">
      We do not retain any other data, metadata except for your email address.
    </p>

    <hr class="opacity-25 my-10" />
    <h2 class="text-2xl leading-12">8. Third-parties</h2>
    <ol class="list-disc m-8">
      <li>
        Your email address will be stored in a database deployed on a <a
          class="underline"
          href="https://turso.tech/">Turso</a
        > Cloud Database.
      </li>
      <li>
        Your email address will be sent to <a
          class="underline"
          href="https://www.brevo.com/"
          target="_blank">Brevo</a
        > as it is our transactional email provider.
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</Layout>
